  "description": "The Quest 1.0 is the SUV of eBikes – robust, versatile, and built to handle whatever your ride demands. Designed with a lightweight alloy frame and sleek internal battery, it’s perfect for urban commutes, weekend adventures, or exploring light trails.\nPowered by a 500W Jaibo rear hub motor and a 48V 13.4Ah battery, the Quest 1.0 offers reliable performance, with a thumb throttle for effortless acceleration and a range that’s perfect for long rides. The 80mm suspension fork and 27.5x2.35” Kenda tires provide comfort and grip on varied terrains, ensuring a smooth and stable ride.\nWith a Shimano 7-speed drivetrain, including a Shimano TY300 rear derailleur and 14-28T freewheel, gear changes are intuitive and dependable. When you need to stop, Tektro HD-E350 hydraulic disc brakes with 180mm rotors deliver consistent and confident braking.\nComfort-focused features include 700mm riser handlebars, an adjustable 80mm stem, and a Reid city sport saddle, offering a relaxed and adaptable riding position. The handlebar-mounted LCD display keeps key ride stats at your fingertips, ensuring every journey is as effortless as it is enjoyable.\nTough, comfortable, and capable – the Quest 1.0 is ready to take on the daily grind or weekend exploration with style and ease.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
